{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_buildr_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_buildr_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "復還的羽獸",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_buildr_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "789320c7574984ab6b73bb5e163aaf8e3e2fcebaca944565bcdb2d1f434e5cbc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……老汐斯塔吹來的風。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天上盤旋著的海羽獸，也是飛到這裡安家的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺……我找到了……走了這麼久，我終於……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深吸一口氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回來了——汐斯塔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒楣的事情都過去了！別再纏著我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來——都是好日子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什、什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……這是我的履歷，它為什麼在垃圾桶裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，您不是說各種管道都試過了，幫我想了很多辦法，就是沒有適合我的工作機會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我的作品集，它看上去還沒被人翻動過！就這麼直接跟履歷一起丟在垃圾桶裡了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安麥爾小姐，請您先冷靜一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實說過會幫您想辦法，汐斯塔人力資源辦公室會盡可能幫助每一位求職者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……沒有人願意找您合作，我也沒有辦法啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以……為什麼沒人聘用我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，您不用在乎我怎麼想，您大可以直截了當地告訴我，這樣我才能做得更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您放心，只要您給我一個進步的方向，我絕不會辜負您的期望！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那……好吧，我就告訴你吧，雖然這個很難改。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原因就是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的運氣太差了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說我運氣差……是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到這堆文件了嗎？光今天投遞來的履歷就有這麼高一堆！我一個人哪裡看得過來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過我倒是有個好辦法，就像這樣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "職員隨便抽出來一疊文件，丟進了垃圾桶裡，紙堆矮了一截。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你明明都沒有看過這些履歷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒辦法，我精力有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是看履歷不就是你的工作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，我必須要指正你，我的工作是幫雇主挑選人才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能否為雇主帶來好運氣，才是我們現在最重要的考核標準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟這幾年汐斯塔實在是遭受了太多不幸，雇主們可不希望再遇到什麼意外變故。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你的履歷，就這樣非常“幸運“地被我丟進了垃圾桶裡……你說，怎麼會有雇主聘用你這樣的倒楣蛋呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒、倒楣蛋？先生，你……我真的很失望……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天，我本來滿懷期待地來這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都想好了，就算要我的只是一個小工程隊，哪怕只是一個發實習工資的助理職位，我也願意去試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你說沒人看得上我，只是因為我運氣不夠好？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你要幹什麼，你先別激動——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你等著，我會自己想辦法的！我會證明自己……沒有工程我自己找，沒有團隊我自己組！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰要你這些，這些……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸！你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安麥爾小姐，你冷靜一點！別——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "辦公室職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的垃圾桶……你、你給我賠錢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賠你個臭羽獸蛋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g3_siestanewstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平靜……平靜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一個不稱職的市政廳職員，並不能說明什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汐斯塔官方城建公司的求職管道行不通，私人建築企業還會有機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果私人企業也行不通，我還可以挨家挨戶去問街邊的小工作室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汐斯塔到處都在施工，總會有地方收留我……吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汐斯塔……真的像爺爺說的那樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，別那麼愁眉苦臉的！要不要嚐嚐汐斯塔的特色小吃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我家店裡的派，可是登上了汐斯塔旅遊必吃榜呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "必吃榜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，別客氣，拿好。首次光顧的客人免費品嚐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢噢好，謝謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嚼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少女的眉頭微微皺起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？你好像看上去不太喜歡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不是不是，挺好吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過……怎麼這麼甜啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒吃過這麼甜的酸橙派。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是酸橙派哦，是改良過的“甜橙派”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“甜橙派”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實就是在酸橙派上多加一點甜味醬啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可……比較酸的那種酸橙派才是汐斯塔的特色小吃吧？我印象裡，爺爺一直做的都是很酸的酸橙派。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他做餡料時，只會選那種通身青綠的橘子，帶一點黃的都不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更不用說加這麼甜的醬料……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，這麼嚴格的做法，夠老派。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，你爺爺是汐斯塔人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是汐斯塔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？那你應該很久沒有回過汐斯塔了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我出生後不久就全家搬到哥倫比亞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得，我就說你的口音怎麼有股哥倫比亞人的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢克！我要一份甜橙派！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，是小路特啊，你怎麼又來我這裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓——！不要告訴哈莉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）我要最甜的那一款！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，拿好囉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝漢克！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小男孩一把奪過店主手上的包裝袋，一溜煙地跑走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然加了這麼多蜂蜜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不僅如此。這餡料裡可是放了三倍的煉乳，派底還塗了一層焦糖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得那麼甜，完全不能算是酸橙派了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，有什麼辦法呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些小朋友們，還有年輕遊客，都喜歡甜口味的。為了更好賣一點，酸橙派也不得不改良口味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今的汐斯塔和過去可大不一樣囉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座移動城市和爺爺口中的汐斯塔，好像真的不太一樣了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並不是一切都變得不一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汐斯塔人雖然接受了新的口味，但是偶爾還會懷念過去的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲，這不是我們市政廳的新晉大紅人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天怎麼有空光顧我這小攤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是剛好路過……也請幫我包一份酸橙派吧，漢克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，不用那麼客客氣氣的。過去在老汐斯塔的時候，我們可不是這麼相處的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這位先生，也是市政廳的……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在把風情街的老店都搞得面目全非之後，我很高興我們還能像過去一樣相處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，改建的事算是處理得不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市政廳給了我們不少歇業補貼，聽說之後還會有更多扶持政策，大家已經很滿意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算有人跟我一樣閒不住，不也還能出來擺攤，打發時間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿好，你的酸橙派，酸得掉牙，風情街這群人的口味我最清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……多虧了大家配合我的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，漢克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……請問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？這小姐怎麼還在這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問二位先生，你們口中的風情街，現在還在改建施工嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何止是“還在”，簡直可以說是沒日沒夜地在施工！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃攤攤主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "街坊裡可都傳開了，那幾個外國富商就等著風情街改建好，把那一片打造成全泰拉最大的水上樂園風景區呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢克，沒有那麼誇張……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "改建，不過是為了幫著老街的居民們，盡快適應在移動城市上的新生活罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟汐斯塔，可不能總是沉浸在過去的美好回憶中啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（汐斯塔的過去……在那條風情街裡，還能看得到。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（可就連這麼一點美好回憶，也……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，風情街現在還在招工嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g13_siestafirstimpression"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "輕一點，我的天……小伙子們，這些可都是我最重要的寶貝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早說不能把它們都送到那間新建好的倉庫裡……它們還……是我還沒有做好準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們不該這樣不見天日的，你說對嗎，我的愛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的，親愛的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店男老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到我們的“熔岩裂隙”音樂燒烤店建好之前，它們還派不上用場，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些可都是我的奶奶傳給我的媽媽，我的媽媽再傳給我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要知道，我一有時間就會把它們仔細保養，給它們擦得閃亮，輕輕敲一下就會有清脆的響！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，我還是不捨得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧老闆！無論是吉他還是爵士鼓，還有那些……是叫木琴還是豎琴來著，我們都包好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一件都墊上了幾層緩震墊，包裝也封得嚴絲合縫的，別說進水了，就連一丁點潮氣都進不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "估計等你們的……音樂燒烤店開業時，這些樂器也不會走音。我們絕不會砸了你們的招牌的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀！誰跟你說那些樂器是我的寶貝了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的寶貝是那些燒烤架！你們也把它們封好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啊？原來那些不是廢品嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——你在說什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡就是風情街……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看上去……這家店在施工過程中發生了點小誤會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們好像吵得越來越兇了，我們不去勸一勸嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用擔心，那不是在吵架。居民們只是還需要些時間去和“舊時光”告別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟這條街上的大部分店鋪，比你我加起來還要年長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽過……在汐斯塔海邊時，那條街的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在花花綠綠的遮陽傘下面，燒烤架在沙灘上搭起來，有比浪潮還要喧鬧的樂聲，居民們聚在一起辦晚會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺說，那時的汐斯塔還沒有完全建好，漂亮的大樓很少，往來的遊客也少……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過人們的快樂，卻一點也不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的爺爺一定跟我的爺爺很有話聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科斯達先生的爺爺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是一個樂觀又脾氣古怪的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢……老人們好像都是這樣吧，有點古怪，又總是很樂觀……明明他們年輕的時候遇到的困難也是一個接一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反倒是我現在……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少女懷著思緒，抬眼望向市中心的方向——\n遠處的大樓很高很漂亮，路口有汽車正駛過乾淨寬敞的街道。\n遊人來來往往，有幾個穿著時髦的正停留在街角，對著牆壁上不知是誰留下來的火山塗鴉拍照。\n明明這裡的一切對於爺爺來說，已經如同他所期待的那樣。\n但對自己而言，這裡的一切還是很遙遠，就像自己仍然在趕來的路上。\n一時間，少女覺得好像有一整顆剝了皮的酸橙梗在喉嚨裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，說起來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我今天看到我的同事們在市政廳工作群組聊起了一位“垃圾桶消滅者”的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說了那位年輕女孩來汐斯塔的經歷，不可謂不波折。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了那麼多彎路還能堅持來到這裡，她一定也是個很樂觀的人吧？我很佩服她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，她好像也叫安麥爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時是我太衝動了……我本來也打算之後親自去找那位職員先生道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，科斯達先生。市政廳的損失，我也會照價賠償的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不是來找你討賠償的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是順路去買酸橙派，順路替我不負責任的同事完成他本該完成的分內的工作——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫助一位前來汐斯塔求職的青年渡過她的職業危機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟我很能理解那種，明明有一身的力氣，卻無處施展、處處碰壁的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，科斯達先生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我到底該怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如先問問你想怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……想怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前……是想問問風情街有沒有哪家店的改建工作還需要人手……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過剛才經過樂器店時，那邊發生的事情……讓我有點懷疑自己到底能不能做好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我對新汐斯塔一無所知，對舊汐斯塔的認識也只停留在爺爺給我講的那些故事裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從黑曜石音樂節，到搬上移動城市，再到我來到這裡以後，聽居民們提起的那場向汐斯塔火山告別的晚會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我錯過了這麼多……我並不了解現在的汐斯塔需要什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確實不了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，那又怎麼樣呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想必你的爺爺剛到那座海邊小城的時候，也不了解它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的你，不是跟他年輕時一樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有的是時間去了解一座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不確定我能不能……我已經浪費了很多時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用想那麼多了，我們走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶你去做你一開始想去做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "與白天時不同，臨近夜晚的風情街施工聲漸漸偃息，到處都洋溢著居民們歡聚時的熱鬧氣氛。\n除了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這家店……連招牌都拆掉了，這是什麼味道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是咖啡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，這裡曾是一家咖啡店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未來一段時間，就麻煩你在這裡工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡工作？是要改建這家店鋪嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可……店主在哪裡？他有初步的店鋪改建意願嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "改建之後，這裡還要做咖啡店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "短暫的沉默之後，市政廳職員給出了他的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老店主已經不在了，這家店也沒有人繼承，所以你的工作並不是改建它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是改建，那是……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拆掉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拆掉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說……要把這間店鋪整間都拆掉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "市政廳職員點了點頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那怎麼可以，我做不到……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還會有別的工人跟你一起，你不需要擔心人手的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於你的薪水……會在市政廳的風情街改建專項資金裡出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你同意接下這份工作，我會代表市政廳與你簽署勞務契約，來保障你的權益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，我不是指這些……我是指這家店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些桌椅，這些櫃子……能看出老店主曾經真的很仔細地在打理它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要把它們都拆掉，也太可惜了……這些明明都是老汐斯塔的美好回憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安麥爾，你聽過候羽和留羽的故事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "候羽……留羽……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是兩個有點熟悉的詞，它們代表什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我小的時候，我的爺爺曾經告訴我一種羽獸的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相傳在那片沙灘上，曾經生活著一種十分古老的羽獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那片沙灘……是指老汐斯塔嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過那種羽獸遍佈天空與林間的時候，老汐斯塔還不存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至可能連汐斯塔火山都還不存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……連火山都不存在，是那麼久遠的年代嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那種羽獸有什麼故事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曾經，它們並不能被稱為“一種羽獸”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是一個複雜的，成員形態與習性各異的族群。族群中包含著從這片大地的各處飛來的、不同品種的候羽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "起初，它們就在沙灘邊的林子裡聚集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們也會有爭執，一些羽獸離開了，也有一些選擇留了下來，築起了巢，共同哺育後代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後它們真正混成了同一個種群，吃著同一種果子，唱著同一首歌……於是，它們在這裡變成了留羽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的爺爺很喜歡這個故事，他覺得，這種古老羽獸和汐斯塔很相像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那……現在還能看到這種羽獸嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕是不能了……在故事的最後，一場連年的大雨引起了海水的倒灌，淹沒了那片林子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那種羽獸也就此消聲匿跡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……安麥爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這只是一個傳說故事罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現實中的汐斯塔，可比那種羽獸要好運得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是忽然想起來，我在哪裡聽過“候羽”和“留羽”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺，酸橙醬罐子上的，是什麼字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，那個是“汐斯塔”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“汐斯塔”？什麼是“汐斯塔”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，原來我們的小安麥爾已經不記得它啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“汐斯塔”啊……它是一顆未成熟的橘子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是“汐斯塔”讓我們這群候羽變成了留羽，“汐斯塔”是我們搭建起的家園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "候羽……留羽……？爺爺說的……我不太懂……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用著急，小傢伙。總有一天你會明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來，安麥爾的爺爺也講過類似的故事啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉，科斯達先生……我又想起過去的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很能體會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時至如今，我也很懷念和爺爺相處的時光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，這些永不褪色的回憶，並不會阻礙我向前看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "忽然，一陣樂聲響起，少女循著旋律望去。\n她看見樂器店的那扇綛色大門敞開，昏黃的燈光落在那些大大小小的包裝箱上。\n老闆和工人們席地而坐，他們手持著吉他、手鼓、沙鈴……還有一些叫不上名的地方樂器。\n一個不和諧音響起，大家紛紛停下手中的動作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂喂，是誰又彈錯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？可能是我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可在我的家鄉，這個小節就是這麼彈的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣，那就一起調整一下吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一些人更改了和弦，一些人放慢了節拍。工人並未更改他的音符，這一小節卻重新變得和諧起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂器店女老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三、二、一，再一起來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是手掌上麻繩磨出的繭，也是肩膀上磚瓦留下的灰♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是我們相聚時歡笑的酒，也是我們分離時告別的歌♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是汐斯塔，這裡是我們的家♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡……就是汐斯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，這就是汐斯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……我是安麥爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說，為了表示歉意，幫我約到了一個建築公司的面試？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可能還是要拒絕您的好意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……今天的事我也有錯。還是非常感謝您，嗯，再聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市政廳的電話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼拒絕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是因為我或許能理解候羽和留羽所代表的意思了吧……不，也不能說完全理解了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，就像你說過的那樣，我還有的是時間來了解這座城市……我也想先放慢腳步，來了解這座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我……決定接下這份工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少女望著那間落灰的小店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在規定的期限內，我會把這些舊傢俱都清空，再把牆壁重新粉刷一遍，讓這間房子回到它最初的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這就是我在汐斯塔的第一份工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
